### Scenario 4 - customer 4 registered today, order above 1000 EUR -> PENDING_REVIEW -> APPROVE -> pay
### 2 x HOM-4005 (890.00) = 1780.00 HT, 2136.00 TTC + EXPRESS 9.90 + heavy 29.00 = 2174.90

@order = http://localhost:8083

# @name cart
POST {{order}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 4 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HOM-4005", "qty": 2 }

### Checkout: status PENDING_REVIEW, reservation held for 24 hours
# @name checkout
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingMethod": "EXPRESS" }

### Paying now is refused (not VALIDATED)
POST {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "CARD", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111" }

### Manual review: APPROVE (reservation extended by the standard 15 minutes)
PUT {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "APPROVE" }

### Payment
POST {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "CARD", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111" }

### Alternative: REJECT instead of APPROVE (run on another PENDING_REVIEW order) releases the stock
# PUT {{order}}/orders/<id>/status   { "action": "REJECT" }

### Fulfilment
PUT {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "SHIP" }

###
PUT {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "DELIVER" }
